    {
      "q": "Which Service NSW centres are closing due to Cyclone Alfred?",
      "a": "The following centres are expected to close: Tweed Heads, Murwillumbah, Lismore, Ballina, Casino, Maclean, Nambucca Heads, Coffs Harbour, Grafton, Kempsey, Taree, Wauchope, Port Macquarie, Moree, Lightning Ridge, Tuncurry.",
      "link": null
    },
    {
      "q": "What is the status of the Mobile Service Centre?",
      "a": "The Mobile Service Centre is also expected to close.",
      "link": null
    },
    {
      "q": "Where can I find more information about Service NSW closures?",
